        "original_id": "835fa816-d3bf-57bf-b72a-f65e03c0ac43",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Gordon Green, Larry Hagman, Caroline Grace Cassidy, Ben Best\n- Roles: filmmaker, actor, director, producer, screenwriter\n- Works: Your Highness, The Foot Fist Way, Dallas, I Dream of Jeannie\n\nFacts:\n- David Gordon Green was born on April 9, 1975, and is an American filmmaker.\n- Larry Martin Hagman was born on September 21, 1931, and was an American film and television actor, director, and producer.\n- Larry Hagman was best known for playing J.R. Ewing in the 1980s primetime television soap opera Dallas.\n- Larry Hagman was also known for playing Major Anthony \"Tony\" Nelson in the 1960s sitcom I Dream of Jeannie.\n- Caroline Grace Cassidy is best known for her role in David Gordon Green's film Your Highness.\n- Ben Best co-wrote the films The Foot Fist Way and Your Highness.\n- Larry Hagman died on November 23, 2012.",
